{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D automation game set at the end of the world, where time loops back on itself. Only time anchored factories and knowledge can be carried through multiple loops, until a way to escape time is discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build production chains to push research forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research  technologies that enable new recipes and bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master time and escape.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather raw resources, craft items, and build structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021110/extras/a99c23ca229b2952c04b7bca8a6266d8.avif?t=1758033398\" alt=\"Production\" width=580 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate repetitive tasks and massively increase production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021110/extras/bf60f8cd56b279b51c6a085c932bcf01.avif?t=1758033398\" alt=\"Automation\" width=406 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new technologies and upgrade your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021110/extras/ab439e1d715dabef1a099b9b83410a71.avif?t=1758033398\" alt=\"Research\" width=330 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</stron